{# Jinja2 lays out the report; ReportLab renders it (build.md Sec. 3.4.2).

   A line-oriented template rather than HTML: ReportLab draws flowables, not a
   DOM, so an HTML template would need a converter that adds a dependency and a
   failure mode for no benefit. Each line becomes a paragraph or a table
   directive that reports.py interprets.

   Directives:
     ##H1 / ##H2   heading
     ##TABLE:name  emit the named table
     ##SPACER      vertical gap
     ##PAGEBREAK   new page
     anything else body text
#}
##H1 {{ title }}

Report ID    {{ report_id }}
Generated    {{ generated_at }}
Prepared by  {{ generated_by }}
Period       {{ period_start or 'inception' }} to {{ period_end or 'today' }}

This report is generated from the FinanceHub reconciliation database. Every
figure is computed at generation time from the transactions, matched records
and exception queue as they stood; no value is estimated or carried forward.

##H2 Reconciliation summary
##TABLE:kpi

{% if kpi.match_rate is none -%}
No transactions were ingested in the reporting period, so no match rate can be
computed. This is reported as unavailable rather than as zero.
{%- else -%}
Of {{ '{:,}'.format(kpi.total_transactions) }} transactions in the period,
{{ '{:.2%}'.format(kpi.match_rate) }} were reconciled automatically. The
deterministic rule layer is applied first; only the remainder reaches the
unsupervised matching layer, and only pairs scoring at or above the configured
confidence threshold are posted.
{%- endif %}

##SPACER
##H2 Match-rate analytics
##TABLE:match_rate

##SPACER
##H2 Exception log
{% if exceptions -%}
{{ exceptions|length }} exception{{ 's' if exceptions|length != 1 else '' }}
{{ 'are' if exceptions|length != 1 else 'is' }} listed below with the category
assigned by the classifier and the resolution pathway proposed for each.
##TABLE:exceptions
{%- else -%}
No exceptions were outstanding in this period.
{%- endif %}

##SPACER
##H2 Category distribution
##TABLE:categories

##SPACER
##H2 Validation and data quality
##TABLE:validation

{% if kpi.validation_detection_rate is not none -%}
The ingestion pipeline quarantined
{{ '{:.2%}'.format(kpi.validation_detection_rate) }} of records presented in the
period. Quarantined payloads are retained in full and can be replayed once the
upstream feed is corrected.
{%- endif %}

##SPACER
This document was produced by FinanceHub for audit purposes. Its identifier is
recorded in the reports table and the figures can be reproduced from the
database as at the generation timestamp above.
